## 7. Code-Pfade (Implementiert)

| Rolle | Dateien |
|--------|---------|
| Logik (Fortschritt, dependsOn, Migration, Rewards-Liste) | `src/lib/rpg-quest-steps.js` |
| Graph-Hooks | `src/lib/rpg-quest-graph.js` — delegiert Fortschritt an `rpg-quest-steps.js`; `buildInitialStepMapFromGraph` rekursiv |
| Formular / Editor-Parsing | `src/lib/rpg-quest-form-helpers.js` — Zeilen vs. JSON, Quest-Rewards |
| Schema-Version | `RPG_PAYLOAD_SCHEMA_VERSION = 2` in `src/lib/rpg-payload-schema.js`; GET `/api/rpg/quests` migriert Graph mit `migrateRpgGraphToV2` |
| Bootstrap | `src/lib/rpg-server-sync.js` — `pickRpgPayloadFromResponse` migriert ebenfalls |
| UI | `src/components/RpgQuestStepsView.jsx`, `RpgQuestHub.jsx`, `RpgQuestTree.jsx`, `rpg-quest-hub.css`, `rpg-quest-tree.css` |
| Editor | `src/components/RpgQuestGraphEditor.jsx` |
| KI | `src/pages/api/rpg/quests-generate.js` — liefert zusätzlich `questRewards` (gleichmäßige Prozent-Stufen aus `rewards`) |

